@MetadataApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5258

### Create asset
POST {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/metadata/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "asset-001",
  "type": "DATA_PRODUCT",
  "name": "Customer Orders",
  "description": "Contains fictional customer order information",
  "owner": "team-alpha",
  "sourceSystem": "dummy-source-catalog",
  "tags": ["certified", "sales"]
}

### Get by uid
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/metadata/assets/asset-001
Accept: application/json

### Get all
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/metadata/assets
Accept: application/json

### Get filtered by type
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/metadata/assets?type=DATA_PRODUCT
Accept: application/json